net/old-kansas-sector-part-2">Old Kansas Sector ~ 2: Tabloid</a>, <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/on-the-outskirts">On the Outskirts</a>, <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/the-first-sailors">The First Sailors</a>, <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/where-have-you-been-all-my-life">Where Have You Been All My Life</a>, <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/where-is-this-going">Where Is This Going?</a></p> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-26" style="display:none"> <p>Tagged k-class, but could not find a specific scenario.</p> <p><strong>SCPs:</strong> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-1238">SCP-1238</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-185-fr">SCP-185-FR</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-1984">SCP-1984</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3274">SCP-3274</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4405">SCP-4405</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-736">SCP-736</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-770">SCP-770</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/shaggydredlocks-proposal">S. D. Locke's Proposal</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4742">SCP-4742</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/proposition-du-dr-gray">Proposition-du-Dr-Gray</a></p> </div> </div> </div> <br /> <br /> <div id="wiki-tabview-122ffd393e183f971683da027cde2751" class="yui-navset"> <ul class="yui-nav"> <li class="selected"><a href="javascript:;"><em>Doomsday Contest Scenarios</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>ℵK</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>TPK*</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>ΩK*</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>ED-K*</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>K/O*</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>MA*</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>BE*</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>GD*</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>GR*</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>ΔW</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>YN*</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>Project Palisade*</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>☿K*</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>MH*</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>ARBH*</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>Öß</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>Other</em></a></li> </ul> <div class="yui-content"> <div id="wiki-tab-0-0"> <p>These scenarios were created for the 2018 <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/doomsday-contest">Doomsday Contest</a>. If you were a team member for a scenario, please feel free to provide a definition or otherwise update your apocalypse! (Also maybe double-check links, some of these SCP numbers were very similar.)</p> <p>Edit: Some of these (such as ΩK and EDK) have gone on to become part of extensive canons, so I have added links to tags for people who want to explore them deeper.</p> <p>*'s represent scenarios with 5+ articles on the contest page (Again, please update! I just used the hub out of <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">laziness</span>- expediency.)</p> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-1" style="display:none"> <p><strong>Scenario: ℵK-Class &quot;Foundation Apotheosis&quot; Scenario</strong><br /> <strong>Hub:</strong> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/apotheosis-hub">Apotheosis Hub</a>, <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/system:page-tags/tag/apotheosis#pages">apotheosis tag</a><br /> <strong>Used in:</strong> 1 SCP, 1 Tale, 0 Other<br /> <strong>Definition:</strong> A state of affairs in which all humanity that remains exists within Foundation containment.<br /> <strong>Alternative titles:</strong> אK-Class &quot;Foundation Apotheosis&quot; scenario<br /> <strong>SCPs:</strong> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3731">SCP-3731</a><br /> <strong>Tales and other articles:</strong> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/twinkle-twinkle">Though I Know Not What You Are, Twinkle, Twinkle, Little Star</a></p> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-2" style="display:none"> <p><strong>Scenario: TPK-Class &quot;Thaumaturgic Proliferation&quot; Scenario</strong><br /> <strong>Hub:</strong> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/apotheosis-hub">Apotheosis Hub</a>, <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/system:page-tags/tag/apotheosis#pages">apotheosis tag</a><br /> <strong>Used in:</strong> 4 SCPs, 5 Tales, 0 Other<br /> <strong>Definition:</strong> A scenario in which all of humanity gains powerful thaumaturgic abilities.<br /> <strong>SCPs:</strong> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3396">SCP-3396</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3731">SCP-3731</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3829">SCP-3829</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4420">SCP-4420</a><br /> <strong>Tales and other articles:</strong> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/the-shape-of-a-gun">The Shape of a Gun</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/a-new-age-of-magic">A New Age of Magic</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/a-farewell-to-arms">A Farewell to Arms</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/thrive">Thrive</a> , <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/twinkle-twinkle">Though I Know Not What You Are, Twinkle, Twinkle, Little Star</a>,</p> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-3" style="display:none"> <p><strong>Scenario: ΩK-Class (&quot;End-of-Death&quot;) Scenario</strong><br /> <strong>Hub:</strong> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/end-of-death-hub">End of Death Hub</a>, <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/system:page-tags/tag/end-of-death#pages">end-of-death tag</a><br /> <strong>Used in:</strong> 13 SCPs, 8 Tales, 2 Other<br /> <strong>Definition:</strong> Immortality is forced upon all life, without any other biological change.<br /> <strong>SCPs:</strong> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3448">SCP-3448</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3984">SCP-3984</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4260">SCP-4260</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4935">SCP-4935</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3827">SCP-3827</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3866">SCP-3866</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4514">SCP-4514</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-2304">SCP-2304</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4979">SCP-4979</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4725">SCP-4725</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4791">SCP-4791</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4206">SCP-4206</a><br /> <strong>Tales and other articles:</strong> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/in-the-clutches-of-life">In The Clutches Of Life</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/omega-k">ΩK</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/societal-census-programme">Excerpts From The Societal Census Programme ΩK-Class Report</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/surgical-identity-perpetuation">GRANT REQUEST FOR THE PERFECTION OF BRAIN TRANSPLANTS FOR IDENTITY PERPETUATION AS TREATMENT FOR AGE-IMPAIRED IMMORTALITY</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/hypnotraline">'Hypnotraline' (TR7K2/2UD9X/53GN8)</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/with-the-reaper-on-retirement">With The Reaper On Retirement</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/ii-tab-po-c-h20-qhs-prn-pain">ii tab po c h20 qhs prn pain</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/the-foundation-wants-a-robot-army">Tales Of The Ethics Committee: 5 Reasons The Foundation Wants A Robot Army</a>, <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/the-doctor-s-dilemma">The Doctor's Dilemma</a>, <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/project-damn-oh-fuck">Project Damnerung</a></p> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-4" style="display:none"> <p><strong>Scenario: ED-K-Class &quot;Lethe&quot; Scenario</strong><br /> <strong>Hub:</strong> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/amnesticization">Team Fuhgeddaboutit Hub</a>, part of the <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/ad-astra-per-aspera-hub">Ad Astra Per Aspera canon</a> (<a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/system:page-tags/tag/ad-astra#pages">tag</a>)<br /> <strong>Used in:</strong> 2 SCPs, 4 Tales, 2 Other<br /> <strong>Definition:</strong> A high number of ED-K Lethe Events occurring at a rate that both noticeably and negatively impacts human society and results in public awareness of the SCP-3848 phenomenon.<br /> <strong>SCPs:</strong> <a 