ef="http://www.scpwiki.com/tales-of-the-automaton-the-big-birdocalypse">Tales of the Automaton: The Big Birdocalypse</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/spc-507">SPC-507</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/the-sacred-djehuti">The Sacred Djehuti</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/avian-anthology-i">Avian Anthology I</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/umbral-migratory-sequence">UMBRAL_MIGRATORY_SEQUENCE.txt</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/avian-anthology-ii">Avian Anthology II</a></p> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-8" style="display:none"> <p><strong>Scenario: GD-Class Gestalt Dissolution Scenario</strong><br /> <strong>Hub:</strong> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/skies-made-strange-hub">Skies Made Strange Hub</a><br /> <strong>Used in:</strong> 1 SCPs, 5 Tales, 1 Other<br /> <strong>Definition:</strong> By using amnestics to try and prevent the exposure of anomalies to the public, these end up creating their own anomalies themselves.<br /> <strong>SCPs:</strong> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3475">SCP-3475</a><br /> <strong>Tales and other articles:</strong> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/a-quiet-night">A Quiet Night</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/into-the-woods">Into the Woods</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/hello-little-girl">Hello, Little Girl</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/it-takes-two">It Takes Two</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/children-will-listen">Children Will Listen</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/birth-of-a-new-day">Birth of a New Day</a></p> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-9" style="display:none"> <p><strong>Scenario: GR-Class Hostile Demiurge Event</strong><br /> <strong>Used in:</strong> 1 SCPs, 1 Tales, 3 Other<br /> <strong>Definition:</strong> N/A<br /> <strong>SCPs:</strong> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3457">SCP-3457</a><br /> <strong>Tales and other articles:</strong> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/obskuracorps-memos">Obskuracorps Memos Acquired in Operation BLACK ROPE</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.