				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-0110-j</guid>
				<title>SCP-0110-J</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-0110-j</link>
				<description>


&lt;div class=&quot;info-container&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-folded&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded-link&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The definitions for all of the object classes come from &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/esoteric-classes-complete-list&quot;&gt;A Comprehensive List of Esoteric Classes&lt;/a&gt; written by Nagiros per the author&#039;s permit. The warning header is an edited version of the one present in &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5391&quot;&gt;SCP-5391&lt;/a&gt; written by J Dune. The comment code comes from &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3309&quot;&gt;SCP-3309&lt;/a&gt; written by LtFlops and FamtomGuy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;u-author_block&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scp-wiki.wikidot.com/ralliston-s-authorpage&quot;&gt;▸ More by this Author ◂&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
