&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Event Description:&lt;/strong&gt; A large number of minuscule, intelligent monkeys began moving out of several individuals orifices. Monkeys lacked fur, with only small amounts of hair, had advanced technology, opposable thumbs, and spoke in a thus far untranslated language.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Date of Occurrence:&lt;/strong&gt; The 12th Cycle, age of Tall ones and Blank things.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Substrait 42A, on the largest landmass.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Follow-up Actions taken:&lt;/strong&gt; All buildings were amnesticized, but the intelligent monkeys could not be tracked due to interference from a monkey based organisation known as the &#039;SCP Foundation&#039;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Event Description:&lt;/strong&gt; A School basketball match between the Marymount School of New York and New Anglia international school. The only anomalous event related to this match was its location and date of occurrence.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Date of Occurrence:&lt;/strong&gt; 20/06/1969&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; West Crater, Lunar Surface&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Follow-up Actions taken:&lt;/strong&gt; Appollo 11 crew provided with Class-A amnestics. Footage of the landing edited and cut to remove all traces of the game. Students involved lost memory of the incident naturally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Event Description:&lt;/strong&gt; At approximately 19:00 hours, foundation geological audio sensors within Veryovkina Cave, Georgia known officially as the world’s deepest cave measuring at roughly 2,212 meters deep began to pick up faint audio around 2,150 meters. Audio recordings after analysis by foundation researchers indicated that several male and female voices were the sources of the previously unknown audio, the voices are thought to be singing 4th Century AD Georgian folk music previously unknown to any modern records. Singing abruptly stopped around 33 minutes later and no known occurrences have happened since.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Date of Occurrence:&lt;/strong&gt; 8/██/201█&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Veryovkina Cave, Abkhazia, Georgia&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Follow-up Actions taken:&lt;/strong&gt; Limited use of Amnestics due to the depth of said site and the fact that all ongoing expeditions below 1,500 feet had been suspended because of high amounts of rainfall in the area. Audio was immediately received by foundation researchers after normal audio was disrupted and two agents have been posted until 202█ to monitor the area for any further activity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Event Description:&lt;/strong&gt; All of the dogs in a local dog park were replaced by Madagascar Hissing Cockroaches (&lt;em&gt;Gromphadorhina portentosa&lt;/em&gt;). Roaches were all the same size as the dogs that were replaced, and the effect lasted for about five and a half minutes before the dogs reappeared unfazed.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Date of Occurance:&lt;/strong&gt; 03/12/2020&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Dog park in Revere, Massachusetts.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Follow-up Actions Taken:&lt;/strong&gt; All pet owners were given Class A Amnestics and all camera footage was seized by Foundation Personnel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Event Description:&lt;/strong&gt; A Caucasian male wearing a business suit, and carrying a brief case was seen manifesting randomly throughout the city of ██████, however no persons has shown any recollection of the event. The following day, in the city of ████████, the same event occurred, and again in ████.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Date of Occurrence:&lt;/strong&gt; ██-██-████&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; ██████, ████████, and ████&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Follow-up Actions Taken:&lt;/strong&gt; The Foundation confiscated all footage displaying the event occurring, and Class B Amnestics were given to witnesses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Event Description:&lt;/strong&gt; A pickpocket, on the run from local police, ran into an alley and hid underneath a cardboard box. Upon entering the alley and encountering the box, the pursuers appeared to lose interest and continued their search, despite the obviousness of the pickpocket&#039;s chosen cover (no other objects of sufficient size to hide an adult were present).&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Date of Occurrence:&lt;/strong&gt; 14/12/2020&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; San Diego, California, United States&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Follow-up Actions Taken:&lt;/strong&gt; Camera footage showing the event was confiscated under a cover story of the cameras needing maintenance. Police involved in the event were interviewed. None of them seemed to find the event unusual in any way, even when shown video of the pickpocket hiding under the box. Following interviews, those involved were amnesticized. The pickpocket has not yet been located but has classified as a Person of Interest.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/carriontrooper&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=260457&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1608755086&quot; alt=&quot;carriontrooper&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=260457)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/carriontrooper&quot;  &gt;carriontrooper&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnotes-footer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Footnotes&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-961106-1&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;. Including Mr. and Mrs. Jefferson, their two children, aged 5 and 12, Emergency Line Operator Michael Watson and (at their request) Field Agent Sam Davidson.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
